{
  "name": "Viral post in my niche → my take in my voice → Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Viral post in my niche → my take → Slack\nWhen a real creator's post takes off in your niche, Postel writes your own take on it in your voice and saves it as a LinkedIn draft. Slack shows you the text, and you schedule it in Postel.\n\nWrite my take works from X posts (not videos yet), so **Only X posts** skips the videos.\n\nNeeds a Postel plan with For You (Pro) and a Postel API credential. Pick your Slack channel in the last node.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "35a70ae8-ed3c-5119-b1b1-df89e97f313c",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyHour",
              "minute": 5
            }
          ]
        },
        "event": "viral.new"
      },
      "id": "92d449b8-b297-5651-a996-821dd54e88c8",
      "name": "New viral post in my niche",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-postel.postelTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "e1f32936-d27a-58c9-adc8-883768d44b35",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.viralPost.network }}",
              "rightValue": "x",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "91bcba54-2230-5c67-a82c-054e08e6b8db",
      "name": "Only X posts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "viralPost",
        "operation": "writeTake",
        "takeFrom": "post",
        "viralPostId": "={{ $json.viralPost.id }}",
        "answer": "",
        "platforms": [
          "linkedin"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9ae0e08b-4527-5574-944c-a0d96f5196ab",
      "name": "Write my take",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-postel.postel",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "#content"
        },
        "text": "=New take on a post that's going viral in your niche:\n\n{{ $json.post.text }}\n\nIt's a draft in Postel. Edit it or schedule it there.",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "da65679c-42fd-52b5-a69d-09c7e9488be1",
      "name": "Send draft to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
